      <!-- whoami -->
      <section id="whoami">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="sec-num">01</span>
          <h2 class="sec-title" data-i18n="nav.whoami">whoami</h2>
          <span class="sec-line"></span>
          <span class="sec-comment" data-i18n="whoami.comment">// who I am</span>
        </div>
        <div class="whoami">
          <div>
            <p data-i18n="whoami.p1">I'm <strong>Luis Ángel Cardona Becerra</strong>, a full-stack software developer. <strong>TSU in Information Technology</strong> (Nov 2025) and studying <strong>Software Engineering</strong> in my second-to-last term. I build complete systems — from database schema to deploy — and led teams of up to 20 students on agile projects.</p>
            <p data-i18n="whoami.p2">My work includes the <strong>Estadías Module</strong>, recognized as the best project of my generation, an <strong>automated attendance system</strong> with real-time pulling from biometric devices, and <strong>UMI</strong> — a ride-hailing platform with Go, PostGIS and React Native for my community in Nayarit, where Didi and Uber don't work.</p>
            <p data-i18n="whoami.p3">I also built <strong>Nakawe</strong>, an AI health assistant with accessibility for people with disabilities, and <strong>Rassa Jala</strong>, an e-commerce for farmers where I led 20 students configuring repos, code review and branch protection. I work on <strong>100% Linux</strong>, apply <strong>TDD and SDD</strong>, and I'm taking the <strong>Google Cybersecurity</strong> certification (Coursera).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sig">
            $ cat .profile<br />
            <span class="dim" data-i18n="whoami.sig.name">name: Luis Ángel Cardona Becerra</span><br />
            <span class="dim" data-i18n="whoami.sig.role">role: full-stack developer</span><br />
